{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blaze of Storm is a standard vertical scrolling shmup. The main character, a pilot, fights against enemies in cyberspace as a cyber diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of weapons are available: a main weapon and a subweapon. The main weapon is a Vulcan shot that is fired in front of the player's ship. The subweapon type can be changed by getting an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subweapons have different performance depending on their type. Some circle around the ship to defend against enemy bullets, others automatically track and attack the enemy, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, subweapons can generate an explosion by hitting the enemy with the weapon itself, and this explosion can cause great damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies appear in cyberspace in a wide variety of shapes, including mecha, creatures, and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a shmup in which you can take advantage of the properties of subweapons and their explosions to your advantage. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the year 794 of the Cyber Century, the nation was managed by a giant computer called &quot;Elixia.&quot; Elixia controlled all aspects of politics, economy, and the military, making war and poverty a thing of the past. However, that peace suddenly crumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unidentified enemies appeared in cyberspace and began to erode the system of Elixia. The city's infrastructure was in chaos, communication networks were cut off, and people faced fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In response to this situation, cyberdiver &quot;Ayame Crow&quot; began investigating cyberspace. Cyberdivers are people with special abilities who can directly connect their consciousness to cyberspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind this crisis, it was discovered that there was a human being called &quot;Phantom&quot; who uploaded his mind into cyberspace. He was plotting to control Elixia in order to lead humanity to chaos that he called freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, the cyberspace battle to save humanity from crisis begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513070?t=1744804517","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513070?t=1744804517","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/46a2fe5dfdcf31354590becfd01146f5700c1b57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744804517","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/46a2fe5dfdcf31354590becfd01146f5700c1b57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744804517","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blaze of Storm is a standard vertical scrolling shmup. The main character, a pilot, fights against enemies in cyberspace as a cyber diver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of weapons are available: a main weapon and a subweapon. The main weapon is a Vulcan shot that is fired in front of the player's ship. The subweapon type can be changed by getting an item.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Subweapons have different performance depending on their type. Some circle around the ship to defend against enemy bullets, others automatically track and attack the enemy, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition, subweapons can generate an explosion by hitting the enemy with the weapon itself, and this explosion can cause great damage to the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies appear in cyberspace in a wide variety of shapes, including mecha, creatures, and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a shmup in which you can take advantage of the properties of subweapons and their explosions to your advantage. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the year 794 of the Cyber Century, the nation was managed by a giant computer called &quot;Elixia.&quot; Elixia controlled all aspects of politics, economy, and the military, making war and poverty a thing of the past. However, that peace suddenly crumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unidentified enemies appeared in cyberspace and began to erode the system of Elixia. The city's infrastructure was in chaos, communication networks were cut off, and people faced fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In response to this situation, cyberdiver &quot;Ayame Crow&quot; began investigating cyberspace. Cyberdivers are people with special abilities who can directly connect their consciousness to cyberspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behind this crisis, it was discovered that there was a human being called &quot;Phantom&quot; who uploaded his mind into cyberspace. He was plotting to control Elixia in order to lead humanity to chaos that he called freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, the cyberspace battle to save humanity from crisis begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TERARIN GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513070/3bacb2ff0600785cd1e2a07db4e91bf9f6191b7b/header.jpg?t=1744804517","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9TERARIN GAMES","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":2571